WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Powerhouse Studio Desk — editorial walkthrough. This is a local browser simulation, not the Framer CMS.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Open News and add a studio note. This editor is a local simulation, not Framer.

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Enter the title and article text. Choose whether the note is visible or a draft.

4
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Save locally. The note now appears in the site preview in this browser.

5
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Edit a director biography, its verified source and the associated films.

6
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Replace the Vimeo link, credit, poster and mobile focal point. Save to preview the new film.

7
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Add a Statement, Image & copy, Film selection or Contact component from the library.

8
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Use the arrows to reorder sections. Hide a section without deleting its content.

9
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Choose a page and section. Edit text, then save it locally.

10
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Choose a supplied photograph or upload an authorised image. Update its description.

11
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Export a JSON backup, or restore the initial demonstration. Original source files stay unchanged.

12
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:12.000
The final handoff video will be recorded in the real Framer workspace delivered to the client. No production changes were made in this demonstration.
